{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01490",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 1.32,
      "end_seconds": 7.17,
      "duration_seconds": 5.85,
      "text": "Doctor, this one's ready for you. Everything's on the chart, but I'll go through it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.74,
      "end_seconds": 12.78,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "thanks hello, come in, sit down what brings you in today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 15.14,
      "end_seconds": 21.54,
      "duration_seconds": 6.4,
      "text": "hello, doctor i hope it's alright if I stay in for this"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.27,
      "end_seconds": 32.74,
      "duration_seconds": 9.47,
      "text": "Um, so... an itchy patch on my wrist. That's why I came. I told my wife I'd come today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.59,
      "end_seconds": 36.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.24,
      "end_seconds": 40.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Since last Tuesday, that's when it began"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.29,
      "end_seconds": 46.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.96,
      "text": "Is it there all the time or does it come and go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.5,
      "end_seconds": 50.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "I'd say once or twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.31,
      "end_seconds": 53.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.28,
      "end_seconds": 79.96,
      "duration_seconds": 21.68,
      "text": "It usually comes with a bit of redness. So, as for bit of redness, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before. There was dry flaky skin, yes, but that went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.61,
      "end_seconds": 84.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.54,
      "end_seconds": 88.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "No, I'm not allergic to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.59,
      "end_seconds": 90.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.45,
      "end_seconds": 97.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "nothing, you know, I haven't had any operations"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.6,
      "end_seconds": 102.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.61,
      "end_seconds": 116.68,
      "duration_seconds": 13.07,
      "text": "No, I've never smoked in my life. Nothing, I'm teetotal. I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours. I do a yoga class on Thursdays"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.59,
      "end_seconds": 137.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.6,
      "end_seconds": 155.75,
      "duration_seconds": 17.15,
      "text": "I've had high cholesterol, yes. I've had diabetes for two years now. Work has been very busy so I kept ignoring it. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.42,
      "end_seconds": 159.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Is there anything relevant on the family side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.98,
      "end_seconds": 165.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "My uncle has high cholesterol. My aunt has rheumatoid arthritis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.34,
      "end_seconds": 171.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 173.8,
      "end_seconds": 186.91,
      "duration_seconds": 13.11,
      "text": "he is on simvastatin, 20 milligrams, at night for my cholesterol, I give it to him. It's Glycomet, 500 milligrams, twice a day for my sugar, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.49,
      "end_seconds": 191.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "right, have you had any spreading or blisters?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.22,
      "end_seconds": 195.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "No spreading or blisters, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.18,
      "end_seconds": 197.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "What about fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.64,
      "end_seconds": 201.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "I haven't noticed any fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 203.0,
      "end_seconds": 207.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "Actually, doctor, I did notice fever. He doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.56,
      "end_seconds": 216.04,
      "duration_seconds": 6.48,
      "text": "No, I don't think I did. Maybe a a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.03,
      "end_seconds": 224.9,
      "duration_seconds": 7.87,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and and what you've noticed. Has your heart given you any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 226.05,
      "end_seconds": 227.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "Nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.49,
      "end_seconds": 231.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Any trouble with the waterworks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 235.92,
      "end_seconds": 238.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "no, that's all fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 250.64,
      "end_seconds": 258.69,
      "duration_seconds": 8.05,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Heart rate 75, saturation 99 percent, blood pressure 109 over 81. Temperature is 36.6 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.18,
      "end_seconds": 261.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.26,
      "end_seconds": 267.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.23,
      "end_seconds": 269.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.62,
      "end_seconds": 286.82,
      "duration_seconds": 6.2,
      "text": "There's a neat red patch where the watch strap sits, with a little scaling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 288.04,
      "end_seconds": 290.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Okay, you know, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.19,
      "end_seconds": 299.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.42,
      "end_seconds": 323.15,
      "duration_seconds": 13.73,
      "text": "For this, hydrocortisone cream, 1%, once a day, one week. It's for contact dermatitis. Stop wearing that strap and and keep the skin moisturised. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 324.16,
      "end_seconds": 327.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "No, that's all. Thanks a lot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.28,
      "end_seconds": 333.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "take care now"
    }
  ]
}